  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The product contains all the non-3D printed parts for assembling various functional Textured Helmet Collection. To complete the work, you also need to download the Textured Helmet Collection and 3D print the remaining parts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"></div>\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Overview</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling various functional <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Textured Helmet Collection. </strong>To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Textured Helmet Collection</strong> and  <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">3D print</strong> the remaining parts.</p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\"></span></em></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 99.9987%; height: 125.5px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong> Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 19.5833px;\"><b>Model Links</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 47.1667px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>Wolverine D3 Textured Helmet</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 47.1667px;\"><span>Budwin</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 47.1667px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/572411#profileId-495164\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Wolverine D3 Textured Helmet</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 19.5833px;\">Deadpool Comic Style Textured Helmet</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 19.5833px;\"><span>Budwin</span></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 19.5833px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/574035?from=search#profileId-497011\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Deadpool Comic Style Textured Helmet</span></strong></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\" style=\"padding: 0;\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">In the Box</h2>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><span class=\"lark-record-clipboard\" data-lark-record-data='{\"rootId\":\"OKsfdVZTpoQRnExo2lIcyoskncC\",\"text\":{\"initialAttributedTexts\":{\"text\":{\"0\":\"Button\"},\"attribs\":{\"0\":\"*0+6\"}},\"apool\":{\"numToAttrib\":{\"0\":[\"author\",\"7118919285765865474\"]},\"nextNum\":1}},\"type\":\"text\",\"referenceRecordMap\":{},\"extra\":{\"mention_page_title\":{},\"external_mention_url\":{}},\"isKeepQuoteContainer\":false,\"isFromCode\":false,\"selection\":[{\"id\":64,\"type\":\"text\",\"selection\":{\"start\":0,\"end\":6},\"recordId\":\"WN9wdvxjroLLKUxZrwrcWzjZnhd\"}],\"payloadMap\":{},\"isCut\":false}' data-lark-record-format=\"docx/text\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></span>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 80%;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Item <span>for Wolverine D3 Textured Helmet</span></strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 80%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>D8x2 mm Round Magnet (20PCS) - CA005</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20%;\"> 2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 100.062%;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 80%;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Item <span>for Deadpool Comic Style Textured Helmet</span></strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20%;\"><strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Qty</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 79.6995%;\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>D8x2 mm Round Magnet (20PCS) - CA005</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"width: 20.0167%;\"> 4</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<ul></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
